The MIT licence above covers the source code only.

It does NOT cover the songs. The game streams 30-second previews served by
Apple (audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com); no audio is stored or redistributed by
this project. Song titles, artist names and recordings belong to their
respective owners. If you fork this, keep it that way — do not commit audio
files to audio/.

crew.js contains the real nicknames and scores of the club members who played
the game. Replace it with your own data before publishing a fork.
